WEBVTT

00:03.710 --> 00:05.190
Say what?!

00:05.850 --> 00:07.260
What, then?

00:07.260 --> 00:11.190
Are you saying you let
those girls run away?

00:11.440 --> 00:13.190
I didn't let them run away.

00:13.190 --> 00:17.200
They went to meet the master of the volcano to restore our hot springs.

00:17.570 --> 00:19.790
That's got to be a lie.

00:19.790 --> 00:21.700
They said that so they could disappear.

00:22.910 --> 00:25.700
No, that won't happen.

00:26.620 --> 00:29.280
I trust them.

00:34.300 --> 00:37.310
The jewels of evolution are scarce.

00:38.110 --> 00:40.930
Valued highly, they are
regarded as treasures.

00:42.350 --> 00:47.270
Those with knowledge,
when seeking power and demons,

00:48.420 --> 00:52.790
use this to increase their skill.

02:17.090 --> 02:19.910
I'll Definitely Cheer You Up!

02:26.850 --> 02:30.700
Why are we hiking up this mountain
so early in the morning?

02:30.700 --> 02:34.090
Come on, we're almost at the rim
of the volcano. You can do it!

02:35.040 --> 02:36.190
You can do it.

02:52.670 --> 02:55.690
We're at the top? Then let's go home.

03:00.670 --> 03:02.300
It's hardened.

03:02.300 --> 03:04.700
You couldn't call this a volcano.

03:05.020 --> 03:07.520
In that case, he must be seriously injured.

03:07.520 --> 03:11.710
The master of the volcano has grown
so weak, the lava has hardened.

03:13.580 --> 03:17.150
Maybe the master of the
volcano is already dead.

03:17.150 --> 03:18.210
What?!

03:18.910 --> 03:20.510
I don't think that's the case.

03:24.020 --> 03:26.940
Is the master of the volcano in here?

03:26.940 --> 03:28.390
I think so...

03:28.940 --> 03:30.890
I'll try calling him.

03:35.770 --> 03:40.860
Master of the volcano, if you
can hear my voice, answer me.

03:42.390 --> 03:43.740
She's acting like a fairy.

03:50.830 --> 03:53.340
What's going on? Is it going to erupt?

04:22.900 --> 04:24.280
He's tiny!

04:24.800 --> 04:27.280
But he's so cute.

04:30.040 --> 04:33.890
Hey, is this tiny thing really
the master of the volcano?

04:33.890 --> 04:36.750
Yes. Though his power seems
to have waned so much...

04:36.750 --> 04:39.010
...that he can't maintain his former size.

04:39.530 --> 04:42.170
I'll try asking how this happened to him.

04:47.520 --> 04:48.920
What? An illness?

04:50.400 --> 04:51.680
I see.

04:52.260 --> 04:53.640
What illness?

04:54.030 --> 04:57.200
Syrorin, can masters of
volcanoes get sick, too?

04:57.200 --> 04:58.550
Of course they do.

04:58.550 --> 05:00.400
They're alive, after all.

05:00.860 --> 05:02.940
Now that you mention it,
Yurlungur was sick, too.

05:02.940 --> 05:07.340
Well, that was because of the Toripu that
had found their way into his body.

05:07.340 --> 05:10.620
It's not good to eat everything.

05:10.620 --> 05:12.290
Is there no way to cure him?

05:13.300 --> 05:14.620
Well...

05:15.590 --> 05:18.130
What? There's a way to cure it?

05:20.150 --> 05:23.260
I see. That's what we should do.

05:23.260 --> 05:25.100
What's he saying?

05:25.440 --> 05:27.550
Syrorin, translate for us.

05:28.020 --> 05:29.110
Very well.

05:30.860 --> 05:36.620
The way ter cure mah illness is...

05:38.130 --> 05:40.710
We've had enough of that joke.

05:40.710 --> 05:42.610
Let me start again, then.

05:43.460 --> 05:45.520
My name is Fire Drake.

05:45.920 --> 05:47.990
In order to cure my illness,

05:47.990 --> 05:51.040
I must consume the secret
medicine of this land.

05:51.040 --> 05:52.090
Oh, I see.

05:52.090 --> 05:54.620
If there's a medicine for it,
why don't you drink it already?

05:54.620 --> 05:55.620
What?

05:57.190 --> 06:01.130
Making the secret medicine
requires three herbs.

06:01.840 --> 06:05.630
The first is the silver flower that
blooms deep in the ravine to the north.

06:06.380 --> 06:10.140
Next is the moss growing beyond
the waterfall to the east.

06:10.550 --> 06:14.290
Finally, there's the mushroom that
only grows in the cave to the south.

06:15.070 --> 06:16.740
If we know where to find them,

06:16.740 --> 06:19.780
why don't you gather the
herbs and make the medicine?

06:19.780 --> 06:21.070
Yeah.

06:22.900 --> 06:25.350
While I should do that,

06:25.350 --> 06:28.640
the illness has robbed me of my strength,

06:28.640 --> 06:31.780
and I cannot leave this place.

06:32.270 --> 06:34.170
How slovenly of you.

06:34.170 --> 06:35.580
But I understand.

06:35.580 --> 06:36.560
What?!

06:36.560 --> 06:38.480
I live alone, and when I catch a cold...

06:38.480 --> 06:43.200
...I can't even go to see a doctor
until I feel a little better.

06:43.200 --> 06:45.880
Are you sure you can compare
your situation to his?

06:46.400 --> 06:49.550
But now we know what we need to do.

06:49.550 --> 06:50.470
What?

06:50.470 --> 06:54.480
We have to gather the
ingredients for the medicine.

06:54.480 --> 06:56.480
Mu-chan, you're starting to get the picture.

06:56.480 --> 06:57.880
I'm not...

06:58.530 --> 07:00.090
In that case, everyone...

07:00.090 --> 07:01.440
Let's go!

07:01.800 --> 07:03.780
Yeah!

07:01.800 --> 07:03.780
What?

07:07.110 --> 07:09.320
Northern Ravine

07:13.330 --> 07:15.810
It's getting colder.

07:17.090 --> 07:21.340
Is there really a flower
blooming deep in this ravine?

07:25.020 --> 07:25.990
Eastern Waterfall

07:31.730 --> 07:34.930
This is the eastern waterfall.

07:37.240 --> 07:38.930
Southern Cave

07:39.170 --> 07:42.560
It's starting to get uncomfortably warm.

07:51.020 --> 07:53.660
There's no way some mushrooms
are growing down—

08:00.160 --> 08:01.440
There it is!

08:01.870 --> 08:02.760
But...

08:15.990 --> 08:19.340
Do I have to dodge those to get across?

08:27.720 --> 08:29.960
This is the silver flower.

08:30.680 --> 08:33.320
But what should I do about this?

09:01.890 --> 09:03.960
I need to get to the other
side of that waterfall...

09:28.890 --> 09:30.800
What a shock!

09:30.800 --> 09:32.590
Okay, one more time!

09:37.100 --> 09:39.760
There's no way I can't do this!

10:10.580 --> 10:14.590
I... I...

10:14.940 --> 10:16.550
I can't do this!

10:17.830 --> 10:19.810
I've had enough!

10:19.810 --> 10:23.390
Why do I have to do this, anyway?

10:23.390 --> 10:25.380
Leviatan should be the one to...

10:30.230 --> 10:33.710
If it were Leviatan, this waterfall
wouldn't be a problem...

10:36.550 --> 10:38.440
Waterfall, please.

10:38.440 --> 10:39.990
Let me pass.

10:47.280 --> 10:48.940
If it were Leviatan...

10:50.170 --> 10:53.430
She wouldn't say it's impossible.

10:58.250 --> 10:59.380
Impossible!

11:09.410 --> 11:11.310
What am I going to do?

11:11.550 --> 11:14.840
If Jörmungand were here now...

11:22.470 --> 11:24.450
If Bahamut were here...

11:25.250 --> 11:26.340
Flames,

11:27.450 --> 11:29.260
melt this ice!

11:32.330 --> 11:33.590
No, no.

11:33.590 --> 11:37.960
I'm sure the two of them are working
hard to acquire the herbs right now.

11:44.870 --> 11:46.820
I need to do my best, too!

11:51.110 --> 11:53.500
I ended up here when we drew lots,

11:53.500 --> 11:56.650
but Mu-chan would have
been a better choice.

11:59.170 --> 12:02.080
Magma, obey me!

12:05.160 --> 12:09.850
Overcoming this obstacle is easy
for a fire user like myself.

12:10.760 --> 12:14.480
But it might be impossible for you.

12:15.580 --> 12:16.750
That's mean!

12:19.830 --> 12:21.260
But...

12:23.570 --> 12:26.450
I won't know if it's impossible
until I give it a try!

12:59.290 --> 13:00.960
That was close.

13:10.360 --> 13:12.590
Mission accomplished.

13:23.830 --> 13:24.780
You're back.

13:26.390 --> 13:28.780
I can't move any more...

13:35.220 --> 13:36.120
Hey!

13:36.120 --> 13:37.510
You moved.

13:37.510 --> 13:39.820
What happened to you? You're soaking wet.

13:39.820 --> 13:41.460
And you look exhausted.

13:41.460 --> 13:43.560
Well, your hair is singed.

13:43.560 --> 13:45.130
It must have been hard work.

13:45.640 --> 13:47.250
Leviatan, your hands...

13:48.010 --> 13:50.170
They're just a little frostbitten.

13:50.740 --> 13:52.350
But it's okay.

13:52.350 --> 13:55.100
The hot springs will heal them right away.

13:57.310 --> 14:01.730
Now that we have all the ingredients,
let's make the medicine.

14:02.190 --> 14:04.740
First, pulverize the
herbs into small pieces.

14:05.070 --> 14:06.380
Leave that to me.

14:08.250 --> 14:10.780
Next, heat them at high temperature.

14:11.060 --> 14:12.410
Okay!

14:12.410 --> 14:13.470
Fire!

14:15.860 --> 14:18.420
Once they turn into a
single glowing mass,

14:18.770 --> 14:20.830
finish it by chilling it with water!

14:22.940 --> 14:24.480
Water, come.

14:25.620 --> 14:26.630
Chill it!

14:32.580 --> 14:33.470
It's done!

14:48.660 --> 14:50.640
The medicine seems to have worked.

14:50.640 --> 14:52.890
But he's still small.

14:52.890 --> 14:54.840
We seem to have cured the illness,

14:54.840 --> 14:57.480
but he hasn't regained his energy yet.

14:57.480 --> 15:01.500
What? Does that mean
we wasted our time?

15:01.700 --> 15:03.390
Not at all.

15:03.390 --> 15:07.800
Once he regains his energy,
his power should be restored.

15:08.180 --> 15:11.510
If he had something to eat
to give him energy...

15:13.020 --> 15:14.010
We have some of that.

15:18.410 --> 15:19.940
The Volcano Curry!

15:19.940 --> 15:21.520
Eat up.

15:27.750 --> 15:29.690
He says it's spicy.

15:29.690 --> 15:34.230
But it's delicious because
it was made with love.

15:34.640 --> 15:35.830
Oh, good.

15:45.600 --> 15:47.250
Wait, is this...

15:59.380 --> 16:01.510
Restoring the hot springs...

16:05.030 --> 16:07.510
It's an empty dream.

16:11.750 --> 16:13.780
Wh-What is that, an earthquake?

16:17.430 --> 16:18.530
Landlady!

16:20.360 --> 16:21.600
Are you all right?

16:44.130 --> 16:46.850
Now this is how hot springs should be.

16:47.550 --> 16:50.350
My frostbite was cured in an instant.

16:51.360 --> 16:56.390
And since the master of the
volcano... Fire Drake, was it?

16:56.390 --> 17:00.200
Since he said he would help us,
we've got a lot to celebrate.

17:01.290 --> 17:05.080
Thank you for gathering the ingredients
for the secret medicine.

17:05.770 --> 17:07.900
I wish to show my gratitude.

17:08.420 --> 17:13.270
If you ever need my help, call me.

17:14.450 --> 17:18.470
Having someone strong like him
help us will be tremendously useful.

17:18.990 --> 17:20.970
Actually, about that...

17:21.370 --> 17:25.150
Remember the pretty rock you used
when you summoned Yurlungur?

17:25.150 --> 17:27.010
The sphe-whatever?

17:27.010 --> 17:28.930
Sphere, the sphere!

17:28.930 --> 17:31.370
You can't summon him without that.

17:32.150 --> 17:35.200
In that case, it was all for nothing.

17:35.610 --> 17:37.320
That's not true.

17:37.770 --> 17:43.490
This important place is full
of the landlady's memories.

17:45.120 --> 17:47.290
We were able to protect it.

17:53.410 --> 17:54.860
Thank you, everyone.

17:54.860 --> 17:58.470
Because of your help,
we'll be able to keep working here.

17:58.720 --> 18:00.650
Thank you so much.

18:00.650 --> 18:03.040
I wish I could make your
stay free to thank you,

18:03.040 --> 18:05.600
but you already paid off your debt...

18:06.040 --> 18:07.580
So instead, you can have this.

18:07.580 --> 18:08.480
What is this?

18:08.810 --> 18:12.530
I'm not sure, but I found
it in our storehouse.

18:12.530 --> 18:14.760
I don't know if it's
enough to thank you,

18:14.760 --> 18:17.080
but you're welcome to take it with you.

18:17.080 --> 18:18.060
Hey, wait!

18:18.060 --> 18:19.780
This is a stone of evolution!

18:20.240 --> 18:24.040
Those things that make
your magic stronger?

18:34.130 --> 18:35.600
What's going on?

18:37.060 --> 18:38.690
Levi-tan, are you okay?

18:40.050 --> 18:43.670
I feel like my body is
brimming with strength.

18:44.200 --> 18:47.310
You evolved! You evolved, Leviatan!

18:48.180 --> 18:51.730
Your magic should have grown
drastically stronger!

18:52.280 --> 18:53.770
Does that mean...

18:53.770 --> 18:56.400
We might be able to defeat
the Lucasite in the temple!

18:56.400 --> 18:58.180
All right, Levi-tan!

20:11.620 --> 20:19.480
Next Episode

20:14.540 --> 20:19.480
I'll Definitely Revive You!
